1
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,940
=When the Lights Rise=
=Episode 21=

2
00:01:10,980 --> 00:01:11,780
Mengde.

3
00:01:12,660 --> 00:01:13,620
It's Mengde.

4
00:01:14,420 --> 00:01:15,080
Mengde!

5
00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:16,650
Kuang Jinpeng, I'll kill you!

6
00:01:18,260 --> 00:01:19,160
Murder!

7
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:20,810
Someone's been killed!

8
00:01:23,940 --> 00:01:24,900
What are you waiting for?

9
00:01:24,900 --> 00:01:25,900
Shoot!

10
00:01:27,540 --> 00:01:29,140
Father, we must save him first.

11
00:01:29,780 --> 00:01:31,700
We can't kill anyone
during today's ceremony.

12
00:01:32,900 --> 00:01:33,700
Master!

13
00:01:35,020 --> 00:01:35,820
Save me...

14
00:01:42,380 --> 00:01:43,180
Yiyi!

15
00:01:43,980 --> 00:01:45,080
- Madam!
- Dad!

16
00:01:45,620 --> 00:01:46,420
- Dad!
- Madam!

17
00:01:46,420 --> 00:01:47,900
- Madam, move aside!
- Dad!

18
00:01:48,580 --> 00:01:49,540
Move aside!

19
00:01:50,460 --> 00:01:51,860
Dad!

20
00:01:54,780 --> 00:01:55,580
Yinyue.

21
00:01:55,780 --> 00:01:57,700
Save me.

22
00:01:58,020 --> 00:01:59,060
Come on. Get him to the hospital.

23
00:02:08,420 --> 00:02:09,980
Yiyi, don't! Yiyi!

24
00:02:10,620 --> 00:02:11,420
Yiyi!

25
00:02:13,060 --> 00:02:13,820
Miss Ding.

26
00:02:14,860 --> 00:02:15,660
Calm down.

27
00:02:17,900 --> 00:02:18,780
Give me the knife.

28
00:02:19,700 --> 00:02:20,860
We'll take you to the hospital.

29
00:02:22,100 --> 00:02:22,860
Calm down.

30
00:02:24,580 --> 00:02:25,300
Miss Ding.

31
00:02:26,300 --> 00:02:27,020
Give me the knife.

32
00:02:30,340 --> 00:02:30,940
That's right.

33
00:02:44,700 --> 00:02:46,580
Yiyi!

34
00:02:48,100 --> 00:02:49,580
Yiyi!

35
00:02:50,900 --> 00:02:52,300
Yiyi!

36
00:02:59,060 --> 00:02:59,780
Miss Ding.

37
00:03:01,420 --> 00:03:02,100
Yiyi!

38
00:03:02,180 --> 00:03:02,860
Miss Ding.

39
00:03:04,740 --> 00:03:05,700
Yiyi!

40
00:03:07,620 --> 00:03:08,370
Zhao.

41
00:03:09,660 --> 00:03:10,760
Zhao.

42
00:03:12,720 --> 00:03:14,870
I'm sorry.

43
00:03:16,100 --> 00:03:18,700
Yiyi!

44
00:03:30,020 --> 00:03:30,460
Zhao.

45
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:33,300
Yiyi!

46
00:03:35,860 --> 00:03:36,660
Zhao.

47
00:03:53,020 --> 00:03:54,100
You haven't eaten.

48
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:55,700
Don't faint.

49
00:03:56,900 --> 00:03:57,420
(Zhao,)

50
00:03:58,580 --> 00:03:59,340
(I'm sorry.)

51
00:04:00,220 --> 00:04:01,980
(I've made too many mistakes.)

52
00:04:03,100 --> 00:04:05,500
(I can no longer face you)

53
00:04:06,380 --> 00:04:07,860
(or even face myself.)

54
00:04:17,840 --> 00:04:19,180
Yiyi!

55
00:04:42,380 --> 00:04:43,380
Give him a few minutes

56
00:04:43,620 --> 00:04:44,660
to say goodbye to his family.

57
00:04:45,820 --> 00:04:47,020
What do you mean, a few minutes?

58
00:04:47,180 --> 00:04:48,780
Ding Zhao is suspected
of murdering Lv Mengde.

59
00:04:48,820 --> 00:04:50,260
I'm taking him in for questioning.

60
00:04:50,330 --> 00:04:51,720
What evidence do you have against him?

61
00:04:51,770 --> 00:04:52,750
You want evidence, right?

62
00:04:53,380 --> 00:04:54,500
Someone has reported

63
00:04:54,620 --> 00:04:55,580
that Ding Zhao

64
00:04:55,620 --> 00:04:58,740
fought with Lv Mengde at the funeral.

65
00:04:58,820 --> 00:05:00,020
Lv Mengde is dead,

66
00:05:00,060 --> 00:05:01,420
and his body was hidden

67
00:05:01,420 --> 00:05:05,020
in the Sanxun Gathering float
next to the Ding residence.

68
00:05:05,020 --> 00:05:05,620
Impossible.

69
00:05:05,620 --> 00:05:06,660
He didn't do it.

70
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:08,160
Take him away.

71
00:05:09,710 --> 00:05:10,300
Wait.

72
00:05:11,860 --> 00:05:12,740
Be careful.

73
00:05:12,860 --> 00:05:13,460
Move.

74
00:05:50,300 --> 00:05:50,980
Dad.

75
00:05:52,710 --> 00:05:53,610
Do you regret it?

76
00:05:55,820 --> 00:05:57,380
You shouldn't have abandoned Xiaozhu

77
00:05:57,820 --> 00:05:59,380
and brought that monster back.

78
00:06:00,460 --> 00:06:01,700
All these tragedies

79
00:06:02,380 --> 00:06:04,860
happened because of you and
your ridiculous superstitions.

80
00:06:05,610 --> 00:06:07,780
People said I wasn't
destined to make money,

81
00:06:08,020 --> 00:06:10,100
so you wouldn't let me
touch the family business.

82
00:06:10,300 --> 00:06:12,660
You insisted on finding
a son-in-law to marry into the family.

83
00:06:15,780 --> 00:06:17,340
They said Xiaozhu brought bad luck,

84
00:06:18,500 --> 00:06:20,180
so you were willing to have her killed.

85
00:06:21,820 --> 00:06:23,820
They said that monster
would bring you prosperity,

86
00:06:23,820 --> 00:06:25,700
so you rushed to bring him back.

87
00:06:27,180 --> 00:06:29,820
You even banned us from
speaking Shanghainese at home

88
00:06:31,100 --> 00:06:32,900
just because that monster
couldn't understand it.

89
00:06:33,420 --> 00:06:33,900
Isn't that right?

90
00:06:45,420 --> 00:06:47,140
You've had your fortune
told so many times.

91
00:06:49,100 --> 00:06:51,020
Did you ever foresee
this happening to you?

92
00:06:55,620 --> 00:06:57,300
Yinyue, we're almost at the hospital.

93
00:06:58,460 --> 00:06:59,300
Keep driving.

94
00:06:59,380 --> 00:07:00,660
Should we go to another hospital?

95
00:07:00,820 --> 00:07:01,500
Keep driving.

96
00:07:01,500 --> 00:07:02,100
Don't stop

97
00:07:02,100 --> 00:07:03,100
until I tell you to.

98
00:08:07,380 --> 00:08:08,260
Revenge.

99
00:08:09,590 --> 00:08:10,940
They're taking revenge.

100
00:08:11,690 --> 00:08:14,510
Those cat women have finally
come to claim our souls.

101
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:16,050
What should we do?

102
00:08:19,420 --> 00:08:20,780
Make sure this is all cleaned up.

103
00:08:21,860 --> 00:08:22,470
Yes.

104
00:08:23,220 --> 00:08:23,660
Let's go.

105
00:09:07,420 --> 00:09:08,660
Yinyue, don't worry.

106
00:09:09,300 --> 00:09:10,740
I'll treat you well from now on.

107
00:09:11,340 --> 00:09:12,630
All my life,

108
00:09:12,900 --> 00:09:14,580
you were the person I trusted most.

109
00:09:15,470 --> 00:09:16,700
But even you...

110
00:09:17,340 --> 00:09:18,500
You deserve to die too!

111
00:10:05,780 --> 00:10:08,820
Do you really have to match
them up one by one like this?

112
00:10:13,380 --> 00:10:17,100
When we first exposed the bosses' names,

113
00:10:18,340 --> 00:10:20,220
no one knew who the victims were.

114
00:10:21,420 --> 00:10:25,580
Then they exposed the girls' names,

115
00:10:26,220 --> 00:10:28,300
but left out the names
of those responsible.

116
00:10:31,420 --> 00:10:34,820
Now that Lv Mengde is dead,

117
00:10:36,340 --> 00:10:38,140
the victims' families may be
desperate for revenge,

118
00:10:38,140 --> 00:10:40,300
but they don't know who to go after.

119
00:10:42,300 --> 00:10:44,260
Unless we make it clear to them

120
00:10:45,300 --> 00:10:47,500
who killed their loved ones.

121
00:10:47,780 --> 00:10:49,620
Are you sure you want
to use your real name?

122
00:10:51,020 --> 00:10:52,420
Written by Yan Qing.

123
00:10:52,540 --> 00:10:54,020
The moment your name appears,

124
00:10:54,540 --> 00:10:56,540
the Kun Society bosses will know exactly

125
00:10:56,540 --> 00:10:58,020
who's targeting them.

126
00:11:00,700 --> 00:11:02,260
Written by Yan Qing.

127
00:11:02,260 --> 00:11:03,020
(Written by Yan Qing)

128
00:11:03,540 --> 00:11:05,740
I've written plenty
of cliches in my life.

129
00:11:07,100 --> 00:11:08,300
Now, just one page

130
00:11:08,300 --> 00:11:09,860
could make me famous overnight.

131
00:11:10,980 --> 00:11:12,100
Why wouldn't I do it?

132
00:11:14,180 --> 00:11:16,660
I'm afraid you might become famous

133
00:11:17,020 --> 00:11:18,380
but not live to enjoy it.

134
00:11:31,740 --> 00:11:35,860
Famous but dead.

135
00:11:59,500 --> 00:12:03,980
(Cat Woman Takes Revenge and Kills.
Villain Lv Mengde.)

136
00:12:14,220 --> 00:12:15,180
Are you all right?

137
00:12:19,820 --> 00:12:21,500
Mr. Jing has gone
to a Kun Society meeting.

138
00:12:21,500 --> 00:12:23,100
He asked me to bring
you something to eat.

139
00:12:24,860 --> 00:12:26,100
How are things going on his end?

140
00:12:26,100 --> 00:12:27,020
Don't worry.

141
00:12:27,060 --> 00:12:28,580
Mr. Jing will take care of it.

142
00:12:29,300 --> 00:12:30,180
What about Ding Zhao?

143
00:12:31,620 --> 00:12:32,660
There's no news yet.

144
00:12:33,820 --> 00:12:36,540
But Mr. Jing said
he's not in danger for now.

145
00:12:37,260 --> 00:12:38,660
As for what happens next,

146
00:12:38,820 --> 00:12:40,300
that depends on Boss Ren.

147
00:12:42,060 --> 00:12:44,100
What about Yan Qing and Mrs. Kuang?

148
00:12:46,260 --> 00:12:47,740
There's still no news from reporter Yan.

149
00:12:47,900 --> 00:12:49,380
Mrs. Kuang has already gone home.

150
00:12:54,260 --> 00:12:55,020
Jiusheng.

151
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:57,860
Could you help me pick someone up?

152
00:12:58,140 --> 00:12:58,820
Who?

153
00:12:59,180 --> 00:13:00,220
Dr. Bai Mali.

154
00:13:01,060 --> 00:13:02,100
Slow down.

155
00:13:02,740 --> 00:13:03,340
Easy.

156
00:13:03,380 --> 00:13:03,890
Mr. Zhao.

157
00:13:04,020 --> 00:13:05,100
Just put it there.

158
00:13:05,100 --> 00:13:05,700
Mr. Zhao.

159
00:13:05,820 --> 00:13:07,940
I heard something went wrong
at the Sanxun Gathering.

160
00:13:08,020 --> 00:13:09,260
What exactly happened?

161
00:13:09,260 --> 00:13:09,940
Oh, dear.

162
00:13:10,280 --> 00:13:11,800
Come on, tell me.

163
00:13:12,280 --> 00:13:13,430
Boss Lv

164
00:13:13,700 --> 00:13:15,580
was found dead on our float.

165
00:13:15,780 --> 00:13:16,590
Lv Mengde?

166
00:13:17,740 --> 00:13:18,880
The police said

167
00:13:18,910 --> 00:13:21,010
your nephew Ding Zhao killed him.

168
00:13:22,380 --> 00:13:23,150
Boss Ding.

169
00:13:23,610 --> 00:13:27,490
Your niece also took
her own life at the altar.

170
00:13:28,580 --> 00:13:32,740
- Boss Ding!
- Boss Ding!

171
00:13:32,890 --> 00:13:33,530
Boss Ding!

172
00:13:33,790 --> 00:13:36,420
Fire! Get some water!

173
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:37,460
Quick! Hurry!

174
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:39,460
- Boss Ding!
- Fire!

175
00:13:39,460 --> 00:13:40,000
Go get some water!

176
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:40,820
Boss Ding!

177
00:13:40,820 --> 00:13:41,300
Hurry!

178
00:13:41,300 --> 00:13:42,220
Get someone to put out the fire!

179
00:13:42,220 --> 00:13:43,660
Move everything inside, quickly!

180
00:13:45,230 --> 00:13:46,510
Thank you for inviting me.

181
00:13:47,250 --> 00:13:48,660
I'm only helping Miss Mei.

182
00:13:54,860 --> 00:13:55,530
I know.

183
00:13:56,060 --> 00:13:57,940
If I hadn't kept Long Feng
at the hospital,

184
00:13:58,420 --> 00:14:00,460
Young Master Kuang
wouldn't have come to harm.

185
00:14:00,780 --> 00:14:01,780
But I'm a doctor.

186
00:14:01,780 --> 00:14:02,780
I had no choice.

187
00:14:03,460 --> 00:14:04,980
I couldn't leave someone to die.

188
00:14:06,700 --> 00:14:08,580
If you'd known she was
going to kill someone,

189
00:14:08,780 --> 00:14:09,860
would you still have saved her?

190
00:14:11,820 --> 00:14:12,620
See?

191
00:14:13,020 --> 00:14:14,180
You did have a choice.

192
00:14:15,500 --> 00:14:16,700
You're an angel,

193
00:14:17,260 --> 00:14:19,060
but you chose to protect a demon.

194
00:14:19,580 --> 00:14:20,420
Angel

195
00:14:20,420 --> 00:14:21,380
or demon,

196
00:14:22,180 --> 00:14:23,020
no matter who they are,

197
00:14:23,020 --> 00:14:24,220
if they're sick,

198
00:14:24,820 --> 00:14:26,380
I have a duty to help them.

199
00:14:26,620 --> 00:14:28,540
Would you kill someone
to save another life?

200
00:14:45,700 --> 00:14:46,980
How absurd.

201
00:14:48,660 --> 00:14:50,660
I actually welcomed
that dead man into the family

202
00:14:51,500 --> 00:14:52,940
as one of our own,

203
00:14:53,580 --> 00:14:55,660
only for him to murder
my husband and my child.

204
00:15:05,540 --> 00:15:06,620
If you truly feel guilty,

205
00:15:07,100 --> 00:15:08,860
then find out what caused his death.

206
00:15:09,260 --> 00:15:11,020
There's still someone in prison
waiting for you to save him.

207
00:15:12,740 --> 00:15:14,340
He was strangled to death.

208
00:15:15,900 --> 00:15:18,620
The injury at the back of his skull
matches Miss Mei's account

209
00:15:19,140 --> 00:15:21,380
of Ding Zhao striking him
in the church's side hall.

210
00:15:21,900 --> 00:15:23,860
But that wasn't the fatal injury.

211
00:15:23,940 --> 00:15:26,180
The actual cause of death is here.

212
00:15:28,060 --> 00:15:28,860
Ding Zhao.

213
00:15:29,740 --> 00:15:31,700
You're facing a murder charge.

214
00:15:33,020 --> 00:15:33,820
What's wrong?

215
00:15:34,220 --> 00:15:35,420
Planning to keep your mouth shut?

216
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:38,100
Fine.

217
00:15:38,740 --> 00:15:40,780
If you won't defend yourself,

218
00:15:42,140 --> 00:15:45,420
then the murder charge will stand.

219
00:15:50,820 --> 00:15:51,780
Jiang Menhu.

220
00:15:53,500 --> 00:15:54,900
You arrested me

221
00:15:55,540 --> 00:15:58,020
because you wanted to prove
I was the killer, didn't you?

222
00:15:58,740 --> 00:16:01,060
So what evidence do you
have to convict me?

223
00:16:03,900 --> 00:16:06,060
On the day of the church service,
did you hit Lv Mengde?

224
00:16:06,340 --> 00:16:07,540
Did you see me do it?

225
00:16:07,540 --> 00:16:08,700
Don't play games with me.

226
00:16:08,940 --> 00:16:10,660
Everyone knows
you wanted Lv Mengde dead.

227
00:16:15,980 --> 00:16:17,380
I did want to kill him.

228
00:16:19,140 --> 00:16:20,380
What I regret most

229
00:16:21,340 --> 00:16:23,860
is that I didn't get to kill him myself.

230
00:16:25,580 --> 00:16:27,060
But if I didn't do something,

231
00:16:28,220 --> 00:16:30,900
you can't blame any part of it on me.

232
00:16:32,580 --> 00:16:34,860
Even if I had killed Lv Mengde,

233
00:16:36,540 --> 00:16:38,140
why would I

234
00:16:38,140 --> 00:16:41,180
hide his body on a float
at the Sanshi Club?

235
00:16:41,300 --> 00:16:42,980
Because you wanted to vent your anger.

236
00:16:43,100 --> 00:16:44,100
You wanted to humiliate the Kuang family

237
00:16:44,100 --> 00:16:45,420
and Lv Mengde!

238
00:16:45,700 --> 00:16:47,100
That's a good idea.

239
00:16:49,300 --> 00:16:52,260
But the float was built
at the Sanshi Club beforehand.

240
00:16:53,020 --> 00:16:54,180
Tell me,

241
00:16:54,940 --> 00:16:56,100
how could I possibly

242
00:16:56,100 --> 00:16:58,660
hide his body inside it
right under the noses

243
00:16:58,980 --> 00:17:00,980
of the Kuang family's workers?

244
00:17:06,140 --> 00:17:09,460
If the body wasn't hidden
on the float at the Sanshi Club,

245
00:17:09,980 --> 00:17:12,820
then your theory that my home
and the Sanshi Club are separated

246
00:17:12,820 --> 00:17:15,420
by just one wall, making it easy
for me to commit the crime,

247
00:17:15,780 --> 00:17:17,380
wouldn't that theory fall apart?

248
00:17:19,580 --> 00:17:20,460
Detective Inspector Jiang.

249
00:17:21,420 --> 00:17:24,380
If you really want to know

250
00:17:24,380 --> 00:17:26,140
who killed Lv Mengde,

251
00:17:27,740 --> 00:17:31,940
I suggest you investigate
the float first.

252
00:17:39,540 --> 00:17:41,820
I don't have time for your word games.

253
00:17:42,220 --> 00:17:43,460
It doesn't matter who killed him.

254
00:17:44,740 --> 00:17:45,940
You just need to confess.

255
00:18:01,240 --> 00:18:04,000
♪And watch the lights
come on one by one♪

256
00:18:04,640 --> 00:18:07,640
♪Like blades cutting
through the radiance♪

257
00:18:08,280 --> 00:18:11,040
♪You may treat me as dust
beneath your feet♪

258
00:18:11,040 --> 00:18:13,000
♪Or wipe me away like ashes♪

259
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:14,560
♪Leaving a cold ending♪

260
00:18:14,560 --> 00:18:16,520
♪But I refuse to fall♪

261
00:18:16,520 --> 00:18:21,560
♪I refuse to become a shadow
fading beneath the lights♪

262
00:18:21,560 --> 00:18:24,040
♪I refuse to dissolve into♪

263
00:18:25,080 --> 00:18:28,040
♪The lifeless light of the past♪

264
00:18:28,440 --> 00:18:31,320
♪I want sharpness at my fingertips♪

265
00:18:31,320 --> 00:18:34,240
♪And steps that avoid
the traps among the thorns♪

266
00:18:34,800 --> 00:18:37,680
♪At dawn, I will look
straight into your eyes♪

267
00:18:37,680 --> 00:18:41,080
♪My gaze clear, illuminating the dawn♪

268
00:18:42,360 --> 00:18:45,000
♪Those who have hurt me♪

269
00:18:45,640 --> 00:18:48,320
♪I choose to pierce through♪

270
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:51,480
♪To tear apart♪

271
00:18:51,600 --> 00:18:57,560
♪To ignite a sacred flame♪

272
00:18:59,120 --> 00:19:01,120
♪I do not pray to the gods♪

273
00:19:01,120 --> 00:19:04,120
♪Nor bow to power♪

274
00:19:04,120 --> 00:19:06,560
♪I will no longer play the tragic lead♪

275
00:19:08,320 --> 00:19:12,000
♪I will stand and carve
the path of my own fate♪
